  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TZ2023IUC028A103
01/09/2023 - 31/08/2025
Self-Steering Sustainable Social Innovation through Training and (e-)Research (4SITe) Concluding the second phase of the IUC with Mzumbe University to adopt socially innovative solutions that combine technology with actionable research capacity in the fields of education, governance, information services and entrepreneurship, the phase out of 4SITe will facilitate in Year 11 the finalization of PhD&#x2019;s, disseminate the results through e-means and in a closing event, and finallly in Year 12 coordinate the handover of all assets acquired during the two phases.</narrative>
  </description>
